Knowing myself, I am very certain, that I cannot promise ongoing
involvement. I would certainly look at and play around with quests other
people come up with, because that's pretty awesome, but I am pretty
sure, that I won't come up with anything new.
I must say, though, that the slowness of the MOO has been a very big
annoyance to me. Not only did every command take long to finish, but the
connection itself seemed to be very laggy - keystrokes would take
upwards from half-seconds to echo, which - as every sysadmin should know
- is *horrible*, even though it doesn't sound like much.

Sorry
  - Timo

